+def test_every_place_the_library_hands_a_sink_a_batch_is_known() -> None:
+    """The late-write shape assumes every caller-thread write follows its own ``_note_orphan_emit``.
+
+    That holds while the orphan path's ``_log`` and the worker's ``_emit`` are the only places outside
+    ``sinks/`` that hand a sink a batch. A new one must be read against the shape before this changes.
